<title>SRI LANKA: S.Lanka 2-year bond yields fall in latest auction.</title>
<headline>S.Lanka 2-year bond yields fall in latest auction.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The auction for two-year Treasury Bonds worth 500 million rupees with a coupon rate if 12.75 percent per annum held on Tuesday, was heavily oversubscribed, the Central Bank said.</p>
<p>	 Amount offered:	500 million rupees</p>
<p>	 Bids received:	 3.36 billion rupees</p>
<p>	 Amount accepted:     500 million rupees</p>
<p>	 Weighted avg yield:  12.42 percent per year (current)</p>
<p>				    12.78 percent (previous)</p>
<p>-- Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
